From 63b2bf84b866ad3e3ea1194d4bbcdbb79796751a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Cai <xicai@blackberry.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Feb 2024 15:39:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] QNXOSG-324: Enable dependency discovery config files

- Default CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX is now /usr/local (can be overridden using PREFIX)
- Redirect installation on host using CMAKE_STAGING_PREFIX
- Unset CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR and CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR to remove absolute path references to them
- Add proper support for staging area via INSTALL_ROOT_nto (and is recommended over installing directly into SDP)

Note: pkg-config files are installed but not used with CMake projects. Using pkg-config files requires a wrapper script over pkg-config, which will be provided in an upcoming port that needs pkg-config.
Upstream-Status: QNX-specific (from qnx-ports)

---
 CMake/AbseilHelpers.cmake                     |   6 +-
 CMakeLists.txt                                |  50 ++-
 qnx/build/common.mk                           |  60 +--
 .../shiplist-sdp-abseil-cpp-internal.xml      | 404 +++++++++---------
 ...shiplist-sdp-abseil-cpp_tests-internal.xml |   4 +-
 5 files changed, 259 insertions(+), 265 deletions(-)

